{"event_id": "evt-2bbe789a6820", "parent_event_id": null, "payload": {"alignment_reason": "clear_enough", "alignment_state": "idle", "clarification_count": 0, "forge_stage": "entry", "hook_kind": "scenario", "learning_unit_id": "lu-23246698", "objective_status": "working", "orientation_digest": "e64cffd3eef0eca9", "phase": "absorbing", "prompt_text": "假设你正在设计一个应用，需要高效管理内存中的数据，你会怎么决定哪些数据应该被优先淘汰呢？你觉得最久未使用的数据应该最先被淘汰吗？", "regenerated": false, "source": "llm", "source_seed_ref": "objective:我想理解 LRU 缓存淘汰。", "temperature_state": "steady"}, "seq": 4, "session_id": "sess-e88f2d53", "ts": "2026-05-31T08:31:11.920467Z", "type": "learning_unit.orientation_generated", "visibility": "agent"}
{"event_id": "evt-4b110b46fbac", "parent_event_id": null, "payload": {"entry": {"content": "LRU 缓存为什么会淘汰最近没用的数据？", "id": "entry-37fc8889", "metadata": {"alignment_state": "idle", "forge_stage": "entry", "hook_kind": "scenario", "learning_action": "await_orientation_response", "learning_unit_id": "lu-23246698", "learning_unit_phase": "absorbing", "mode": "study", "objective_status": "working", "orientation_context_present": true, "persona_key": "neutral", "persona_name": "默认", "persona_role": "", "temperature_state": "steady"}, "parent_id": null, "role": "user", "timestamp": "2026-05-31T08:31:11.922421Z", "tool_calls": [], "tool_results": [], "type": "message"}}, "seq": 5, "session_id": "sess-e88f2d53", "ts": "2026-05-31T08:31:11.922720Z", "type": "message.user_appended", "visibility": "agent"}
{"event_id": "evt-3d1d0ce68aa8", "parent_event_id": null, "payload": {"entry": {"content": "我先按这个目标带你学：理解 LRU 缓存淘汰机制。\n\n### 学习地图\n- LRU 的基本概念和原理\n- 为什么 LRU 会淘汰最近最少使用的数据\n- LRU 在实际应用中的表现\n- LRU 的优缺点\n\n### 第一段实质讲解 - LRU 的基本概念和原理\nLRU 是 \"Least Recently Used\" 的缩写，中文意思是“最近最少使用”，是一种常用的缓存置换算法。当缓存满了之后，如果需要添加新的数据项，则会移除最近最久未被访问的数据项以腾出空间。LRU 算法的核心思想是基于这样一个假设：如果一个数据项在最近一段时间内没有被访问，那么它在未来的一段时间内也不会被访问到。\n\n为了实现 LRU 算法，我们需要一种数据结构来追踪每个条目的访问顺序。通常这种数据结构是一个双向链表结合哈希表的形式。双向链表用于保持数据项的访问顺序（新近访问过的放在前面），而哈希表则提供了快速查找的能力。每当一个数据项被访问时，我们将其移动到链表头部；当需要插入新数据项且缓存已满时，就从链表尾部删除那个最久未被访问的数据项。\n\n通过这种方式，LRU 算法能够有效地管理有限的内存资源，确保经常被访问的数据可以快速获取，同时淘汰那些不太可能再次被请求的数据。这有助于提高系统性能，尤其是在处理大量数据查询的应用场景中。接下来，我们将深入探讨为什么 LRU 会选择淘汰最近最少使用的数据以及其背后的逻辑。", "id": "entry-5d32f29d", "metadata": {"alignment_state": "idle", "forge_stage": "entry", "has_tool_calls": false, "hook_kind": "scenario", "learning_action": "await_orientation_response", "learning_unit_id": "lu-23246698", "learning_unit_phase": "absorbing", "mode": "study", "objective_status": "working", "orientation_context_present": true, "persona_key": "neutral", "persona_name": "默认", "persona_role": "", "reasoning_content": "", "temperature_state": "steady", "turn": 1, "turn_usage": {"actual_completion_tokens": 345, "actual_prompt_tokens": 1956, "actual_total_tokens": 2301, "compaction": {"full_compact_applied": false, "full_compact_scope": null, "micro_compact_applied": false, "recent_token_budget": 24000, "summary_block_present": false}, "context_limit": 128000, "estimated_prompt_tokens": 302, "is_estimated": false, "utilization_ratio": 0.0024}}, "parent_id": null, "role": "assistant", "timestamp": "2026-05-31T08:31:54.334404Z", "tool_calls": [], "tool_results": [], "type": "message"}}, "seq": 6, "session_id": "sess-e88f2d53", "ts": "2026-05-31T08:31:54.335844Z", "type": "message_end", "visibility": "agent"}
